WEBVTT

00:07:59.704 --> 00:08:02.496
since she'd gone through
a failed embryo transfer.

00:08:02.538 --> 00:08:06.538
She thought she was being asked
to come in for routine testing,

00:08:06.579 --> 00:08:10.038
but was met with a roomful
of doctors, lawyers,

00:08:10.079 --> 00:08:14.163
mental health professionals
that told her there'd been a mistake.

00:08:14.163 --> 00:08:17.288
Her embryo had been transferred
to another patient,

00:08:17.329 --> 00:08:20.829
and her genetic son
had been born in New York.

00:08:21.121 --> 00:08:22.579
One of the twins.

00:08:23.746 --> 00:08:26.788
A judge in New York determined
that the birth parents

00:08:26.788 --> 00:08:29.288
were not the legal parents
to the children.

00:08:29.329 --> 00:08:30.538
Instead,